{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Mystic Merchant&quot; is a quirky first-person shop management game, catering to adventurers in this\u00a0fantasy world<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/Titles_Design_a.png?t=1748129904\" />Craft the perfect store layout, blending functionality with charm to guide customers seamlessly through your shop. Strategically place each item to catch their eye, and fine-tune every detail to create a space that\u2019s both efficient and enchanting. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/Anim_Design.gif?t=1748129904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/Titles_Supply_a.png?t=1748129904\" />Order supplies and stock your shelves with care, transforming your open workspace into a bustling hub of activity. Organize item containers and arrange shelves thoughtfully, creating a seamless flow that keeps your shop running smoothly and your customers delighted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/Anim_Supply.gif?t=1748129904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/Titles_Cashier_a.png?t=1748129904\" />Efficiently handle checkouts, process payments, and provide change with precision and speed to maximize profits.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/Anim_Cashiering.gif?t=1748129904\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527890/extras/Titles_MarketPrices_a.png?t=1748129904\